### Legacy Code Modernizer — API Requests
### Run the app first (config 3) with Docker services up (config 1).
### IntelliJ: open this file and click ▶ next to any request.

@base = http://localhost:8080
@petclinic = {{$projectDir}}/benchmarks/spring-petclinic/src/main/java

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HEALTH
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### App health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health

### App info
GET {{base}}/actuator/info


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# JOBS  — lifecycle: create → analyze → index-rag → advance states
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Create a job pointing at PetClinic
# @name createJob
POST {{base}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "petclinic-modernisation",
  "sourceDirectory": "{{$projectDir}}/benchmarks/spring-petclinic/src/main/java"
}

### 2. Get job (replace {id} with the id from step 1)
GET {{base}}/api/jobs/1

### 3. List all jobs
GET {{base}}/api/jobs

### 4. Run static analysis + Louvain clustering
# Extracts class graph, ingests into Neo4j, runs Python Louvain, returns cluster map.
POST {{base}}/api/jobs/1/analyze

### 5. Advance job state (PENDING→ANALYZING→PLANNING→GENERATING→DONE)
POST {{base}}/api/jobs/1/advance

### 6. Mark job failed with a reason
POST {{base}}/api/jobs/1/fail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Source directory not found"
}

### 7. Retry a failed job (resets to PENDING)
POST {{base}}/api/jobs/1/retry


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# RAG INDEXING  — chunk → CodeBERT embed → Qdrant upsert
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8. Index PetClinic source into Qdrant (job_1 collection)
# Requires: Qdrant running on :6333  +  Python deps installed
# First run downloads microsoft/codebert-base (~500 MB).
# Typical time: 60–90 s on CPU.
POST {{base}}/api/jobs/1/index-rag

### Expected response:
# {
#   "jobId": 1,
#   "collection": "job_1",
#   "chunksIndexed": 79
# }


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# QDRANT  — verify collection directly
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 9. List all Qdrant collections
GET http://localhost:6333/collections

### 10. Describe job_1 collection
GET http://localhost:6333/collections/job_1

### 11. Count points in job_1
GET http://localhost:6333/collections/job_1/points/count

### 12. Retrieve a single point by id (0-indexed)
GET http://localhost:6333/collections/job_1/points/0


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NEO4J  — verify graph ingestion
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 13. Neo4j REST discovery
GET http://localhost:7474/

### 14. Cypher: count all class nodes
POST http://localhost:7474/db/neo4j/tx/commit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic bmVvNGo6bmVvNGpfcGFzc3dvcmQ=

{
  "statements": [
    { "statement": "MATCH (c:Class) RETURN count(c) AS total" }
  ]
}

### 15. Cypher: show top-10 classes by outgoing call edges
POST http://localhost:7474/db/neo4j/tx/commit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic bmVvNGo6bmVvNGpfcGFzc3dvcmQ=

{
  "statements": [
    {
      "statement": "MATCH (c:Class)-[:CALLS]->(t:Class) RETURN c.fqn AS caller, count(t) AS calls ORDER BY calls DESC LIMIT 10"
    }
  ]
}


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# PHASE 3.4 — Bundle Assembler
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 16. Download bundle ZIP for a job (replace 1 with your job ID)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/jobs/1/bundle
Accept: application/zip


# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
